      "description": "Mass properties. Validated, never trusted — see L1.\n\nA wrong inertia tensor raises no error. The simulation runs and the physics\nis wrong in a way that reads as a controller bug, which is why\n``cite_tools.validate.physical`` checks positive-definiteness and the\ntriangle inequality rather than assuming the author got it right.",
      "properties": {
        "com_m": {
          "default": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 3,
          "prefixItems": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Com M",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "ixx": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Ixx",
          "type": "number"
        },
